{{/UI}}

== Trivia ==
* For the first week after its release, the '''Smithmonger''' was available exclusively to players who had contributed to City Project, but became available for all players on October 27th, 2020.
* The '''Smithmonger''' used to sell [[Reforge Anvil|Reforge Anvils]], before these were removed.

